---
layout: base.njk
title: Доклады Алексея Авдеева
permalink: /talks/
description: Избранные доклады Алексея Авдеева о разработке, архитектуре, AI и продукте.
---

<section class="section section--page-header">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <h1 class="page-title">Доклады</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">
      {{ "26 докладов о разработке, архитектуре и экономике технологий. Здесь — избранные записи и слайды." | typo }}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--talks">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="talks-list talks-list--full">
      {% for talk in talks %}
        <article class="talk-card talk-card--full">
          <h2 class="talk-card__title">{{ talk.title }}</h2>
          <p class="talk-card__event">{{ talk.event }}</p>
          <p class="talk-card__thesis">{{ talk.theses | typo }}</p>
          {% if talk.links.slides or talk.links.video %}
            <div class="talk-card__links">
              {% if talk.links.video %}
                <a href="{{ talk.links.video }}" class="talk-card__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Видео</a>
              {% endif %}
              {% if talk.links.slides %}
                <a href="{{ talk.links.slides }}" class="talk-card__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Слайды</a>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
